    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23f9\ufe0e\u00a0Game Description\u00a0\u23f9\ufe0e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun dungeon exploration RPG game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, &quot;Memelis,&quot; heads to the dungeon in search of treasure to pay off her debts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, she will encounter fearsome monsters and heartwarming companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will she be able to find the treasure and clear her debts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e\u00a0Game Features\u00a0\u23f9\ufe0e</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic Japanese-style RPG adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich dungeon maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and absurd storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn money not just by treasure hunting, but through various other ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e Characters \u23f9\ufe0e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490890/extras/8ddf99e16774a52a552bdb30ec43d35e.avif?t=1755245907\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\u00a0Memelis<strong>\u00a0</strong>\u25c0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To her, a full card deck is better than a full belly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490890/extras/e23807cacf748da2eae2163e14df61cb.avif?t=1755245907\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\u00a0Tina<strong>\u00a0</strong>\u25c0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The serious childhood playmate, the great Saintess.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23f9\ufe0e\u00a0Game Description\u00a0\u23f9\ufe0e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun dungeon exploration RPG game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, &quot;Memelis,&quot; heads to the dungeon in search of treasure to pay off her debts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, she will encounter fearsome monsters and heartwarming companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will she be able to find the treasure and clear her debts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e\u00a0Game Features\u00a0\u23f9\ufe0e</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic Japanese-style RPG adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich dungeon maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and absurd storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn money not just by treasure hunting, but through various other ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u23f9\ufe0e Characters \u23f9\ufe0e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490890/extras/8ddf99e16774a52a552bdb30ec43d35e.avif?t=1755245907\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\u00a0Memelis<strong>\u00a0</strong>\u25c0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To her, a full card deck is better than a full belly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490890/extras/e23807cacf748da2eae2163e14df61cb.avif?t=1755245907\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\u00a0Tina<strong>\u00a0</strong>\u25c0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The serious childhood playmate, the great Saintess.</p>",
